gametitle=Killzone (SCUS-97402) - KillzoneRecomp parity reference-run input hook v2 (temporary)
// scePadRead call at 0x416d98 goes through a cave at 0xFF000. When the word at 0xFFF00 is non-zero the 18 bytes at 0xFFF10 replace
// pad reply bytes 2..19 (buttons, sticks, pressure bytes), so any button/stick combination can be injected over PINE.
